Counter for Tezbar — standalone Rust process extension

Original Raycast extension "counter" by EvanZhouDev; contributor pernielsentikaer.
Upstream: https://github.com/raycast/extensions, path extensions/counter,
commit 6734d85992290066fd31a7f5bee3cca3d3545a1a (MIT, Copyright (c) 2021 Raycast).
Tezbar port by almatkai (MIT, Copyright (c) 2026 almatkai).
The original command icon is preserved unchanged (resources/assets/command-icon.png).

The executable statically links the Tezbar Rust extension SDK
(https://github.com/almatkai/tezbar-extension-sdk-rust, revision
aaec571673ab64a85a136cf6bd054ef660c4d93c), Copyright 2026 Almat, Apache-2.0;
see licenses/Apache-2.0.txt. Counter-derived code and assets: licenses/counter-MIT.txt.
